@base = http://localhost:3001
@token = replace-with-access-token

### Register a customer
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"customer@example.test","password":"DemoPass123!"}

### List products
GET {{base}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### Add product to cart
POST {{base}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":"canvas-backpack","quantity":1}

### Create order (retry-safe)
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-001

### Start payment (retry-safe)
POST {{base}}/payments/ORDER_ID/intents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-payment-001
